7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Beer, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","review_id":"rSE6oAGNhJByAkko5mU0YQ","date":"2015-06-29T19:44:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.923367977142334,"text_excerpt":"Came back for another dinner last Saturday. And, if possible, I love this place even more. I posted pics of everything we ate - and absolutely EVERYTHING was delicious. The curry was probably my favorite dish of all (and I am a self-proclaimed curry snob as I lived on the curry mile for a year in Manchester, England). I cannot wait to go back to try the other half of their small plates menu. I also have yet to try one of their main entrees (I always get distracted by the awesome small plates). The only items I forgot to snap pics of were the desserts. We had the berries (done several ways - fried blackberries - amazing - and pickled blueberries, etc) and the DOUGHNUT! OMG the doughnut was..."},{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","review_id":"UCsJFdQnwN68ffN6ukqa6g","date":"2015-06-04T17:28:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9134869575500488,"text_excerpt":"Where to start?! This place was amazing!! From the ambiance and decor to the service and food it was 5 stars all around! There is nothing in Nola like this place! I was with a group of 6 and we basically ordered every small plate they had, some twice. No one in our party was disappointed. We also had 2 of the Thalis which are basically an entree: protein, starch and veggie and most are offered as small plates too. We had the tofu one and the lamb. I wish I could remember the names of everything we tried. I know the bean salad was incredible, so tasty and also the shrimp fritters. So much flavor all around, every bite was something new and wonderful! The drinks at the moment are Gemini ins..."},{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","review_id":"juplTc7O-XAxy3MEOwGuXA","date":"2015-08-28T04:13:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9127581119537354,"text_excerpt":"Showed up around 8pm on a Thursday night. Immediately was taken back by the place's peculiar menu and theme. I work no more than three blocks away but this place must be experienced at night to be appreciated. Progressive: vegetarians like myself and our carnivore counterparts will find the food delicious and unique. Fabulous service and eclectic drinks. A great, welcoming experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","photo_id":"V3LiFLUalVgJzS3R_YDxiA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/V3LiFLUalVgJzS3R_YDxiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9101728200912476},{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","photo_id":"qi4C59HSfvdjURU0H2rgXA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qi4C59HSfvdjURU0H2rgXA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.904367208480835},{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","photo_id":"BI10NBWb4bYHo_WuKm4EZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BI10NBWb4bYHo_WuKm4EZw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9007692337036133},{"business_id":"yYr6etwcJPbJCXVc2FvOIg","photo_id":"BSGbOM_QdMFBm_yWh2n86A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BSGbOM_QdMFBm_yWh2n86A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8953086137771606}]},"notebook_case":null}
